{"id":"302b3328b775d21b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-universal-closure.md","title":"Universal Closure in the Local Arithmetic Language","display":"df-universal-closure — Universal Closure in the Local Arithmetic Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-universal-closure","aliases":["92-df-universal-closure"],"display":"df-universal-closure — Universal Closure in the Local Arithmetic Language","source":"原书第 III 章 pp. 29–30 允许归纳式含自由参数；闭句桥接为本地补充","source_status":"本地语法与语义桥接","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-universal-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-universal-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-closure — Universal Closure in the Local Arithmetic Language"},{"key":"source","html":"原书第 III 章 pp. 29–30 允许归纳式含自由参数；闭句桥接为本地补充"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地语法与语义桥接"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>；变量按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1,\\ldots\">\\(v_0,v_1,\\ldots\\)</span> 排序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_G,\\mathrm{UCl}_G[A]\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_G,\\mathrm{UCl}_G[A]\\)</span> 为定义目标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\{v_{i_1},\\ldots,v_{i_k}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\{v_{i_1},\\ldots,v_{i_k}\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_k\">\\(i_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_k\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_{i_1}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_k}\\,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\n\\qquad \\mathrm{UCl}_G[A]\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_{i_1}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_k}\\,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\n\\qquad \\mathrm{UCl}_G[A]\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自由变量集有限，所以有唯一的递增列表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时取原句子。只绑定原公式的自由变量，不做替换或改变已有绑定。\n由全称量词语义，任意非空算术结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span> 当且仅当每个赋值都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。因此开放公理集与其全称闭包有相同模型。Hilbert 演算有 Gen 和全称实例化时，也给出相同的闭句定理。\n本地 PA 的参数归纳实例可能开放；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span>、闭句理论和紧致性使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\)</span>，不能默认为开放实例已经属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$；变量按 $v_0,v_1,\\ldots$ 排序；$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ 见[[92-df-free-variable-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,v_1,\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_G,\\mathrm{UCl}_G[A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\{v_{i_1},\\ldots,v_{i_k}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i_1<\\cdots<i_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_{i_1}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_k}\\,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G,\n\\qquad \\mathrm{UCl}_G[A]\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_G(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false}],"bytes":1797,"backlinks":[{"id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"开放参数归纳实例仍保留在 $\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ 中；若需要闭句公理集，使用 $\\mathrm{PA}^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]$，见[[92-df-universal-closure]]。两种呈现有相同模型和闭句定理；不把它们当作字面相同集合。"},{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本次修复重点为：同语言系统族的 Con/Complete/Th 签名，开放 PA 公理的全称闭包，IΔ0 演算中的逻辑公理，一般语言的语法/语义/有限演算，以及集合论扩展的成员语言类型。固定点复杂度条目补给具体见证；Craig 与创造集条目补给可检查的构造步骤。[[92-df-universal-closure]]、[[92-df-first-order-language]]、[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]、[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]记录新增接口。"},{"id":"7c3e3d72ee35c3e0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c75bb5270ee96d5a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcf794bdb0764404","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ 是开放 PA 公理的全称闭包，见[[92-df-universal-closure]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]把本地 PA 的开放参数公理转换为闭句集；[[92-df-consistent]]、[[92-df-complete-system]]与[[92-df-theory-set]]在相同算术签名下接受一般形式系统。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","90f32e29c9d553ed","2b7f27c890af1dc3"]}